Welcome to your June CloudOffice Digest! This month, we’ve rolled out some exciting new features and gathered helpful tips to make your workflow even smoother.

**What’s New?**
- **Collaborative Whiteboard:** Now available in all team plans—perfect for brainstorming sessions. [Learn more](https://www.cloudoffice.example/whiteboard)
- **Enhanced Security Settings:** Simplified controls for managing permissions and access. [View guide](https://help.cloudoffice.example/security-settings)

**Tip of the Month:**
Did you know you can schedule emails to send later? Just click the clock icon in the compose window. [See how](https://www.cloudoffice.example/schedule-emails)

**Upcoming Webinar:**
Join us on June 20th for "Maximizing Productivity with CloudOffice." [Register here](https://events.cloudoffice.example/webinar-june-2024)

